{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-phone-screens-2-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-10","surface":"phone","area":"phone/screens-2","refs":["F-phone-123","F-phone-201"],"severity":"S4","title":"Build a plan shows each planned exercise on one line, so long names are cut off on a narrow phone","what":"On the plan check step, every exercise name and its \"Then:\" line is held to one line, next to the sets and a round Swap button. 61 exercise names in the library are over 26 letters, so on a 320 to 390 px phone many end in three dots and the member cannot read which exercise was picked before saving.","expected":"The full exercise name is always readable, wrapping to a second line when needed.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/app/plan/build.tsx:175-197"],"root_cause_key":"plan-preview-name-one-line","who":"members who build a plan on a small phone","how_often":"every plan with a long exercise name","fix_line":"Let the name and the Then line wrap to two lines","fix_size":"small","proof":"code-read","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-phone-screens-2-02","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-10","surface":"phone","area":"phone/screens-2","refs":["F-phone-224","F-phone-129"],"severity":"S3","title":"After the first tick, the app has no way to open the privacy notice or the terms again","what":"The privacy notice and terms links appear only inside the agreement box, and that box is shown only until it has been ticked once on the phone. Settings has no Privacy or Terms row, and About holds only Credits, the exercise database link and the version. A member who wants to re-read what is shared with their gym, or how to delete their data, cannot find it in the app.","expected":"Settings (About or Help) always has a link to the privacy notice and the terms; Google Play also asks for the privacy policy inside the app.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/components/settings/AccountCard.tsx:82-91","apps/mobile/src/shop/JoinAgreement.tsx:46","apps/mobile/src/app/settings/about.tsx:18-33","apps/mobile/src/components/settings/settingsLines.ts:141-143"],"root_cause_key":"privacy-link-only-before-agreeing","who":"every member","how_often":"every time they look for it","fix_line":"Add Privacy notice and Terms rows to Settings, About","fix_size":"small","proof":"code-read","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-phone-screens-2-03","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"10","surface":"phone","area":"phone/screens-2","refs":["F-phone-122","F-phone-202","F-phone-201"],"severity":"S4","title":"One group of routines is called a plan, a program, a folder and your routines on the same few screens","what":"Find a plan offers \"a plan built for you, or a ready program\"; following it says \"Follow this plan\" or \"Add to my routines\"; the result is announced as \"Routines added. They are in a new folder\" or \"Folder updated\"; the routine editor then shows it as \"Your plan\". A first-time member meets four names for the same thing and cannot tell if they are different.","expected":"One name for a set of routines (for example plan), used the same way on every screen, with folder kept for the member's own grouping only.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/app/programs/index.tsx:76-77","apps/mobile/src/app/programs/index.tsx:92","apps/mobile/src/app/programs/[key].tsx:99-107","apps/mobile/src/app/routines/[id].tsx:748","apps/mobile/src/app/plan/build.tsx:152"],"root_cause_key":"routine-group-has-four-names","who":"members picking or building a plan","how_often":"every plan added","fix_line":"Pick one word and use it on all plan screens","fix_size":"small","proof":"code-read","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
